`,p.jsxs(l.p,{children:[p.jsxs(l.strong,{children:["How can ",p.jsx("abbr",{children:"PL"})," techniques improve ",p.jsx("abbr",{children:"UI"})," programming models?"]})," That is, how can we use compilation, program analysis, and type systems to design better ",p.jsx("abbr",{children:"UI"})," programming models compared to just working at the library-level? ",p.jsx(l.a,{href:"https://elm-lang.org/",children:"Elm"})," and ",p.jsx(l.a,{href:"https://svelte.dev/",children:"Svelte"})," are good preliminary examples of this idea, but I want to go farther around ideas like dependency analysis and formal verification."]}),`
