`,p.jsxs(l.li,{children:[`
`,p.jsxs("p",{children:["An interesting domain to study is tabular data analytics, because there are dozens of meaningfully different ways to express the same concept. I wrote the ",p.jsx(l.a,{href:"https://willcrichton.net/expressiveness-benchmark",children:"Expressiveness Benchmark"})," (2020) as a side project to experiment with different metrics for comparing the expressiveness of analytics languages and ",p.jsx("abbr",{children:"API"}),"s."]}),`
