`,p.jsxs(l.p,{children:[p.jsx(l.strong,{children:"How do abstractions affect the load on cognitive resources during different programming tasks?"})," People have low-level cognitive resources like ",p.jsx(l.em,{children:"perception"}),", ",p.jsx(l.em,{children:"working memory"}),", and ",p.jsx(l.em,{children:"long-term memory"})," that contribute to the higher-level process of conscious thought. Abstractions can influence code's perceptual structure (e.g., reading order or visual salience) and mnemonic structure (e.g., how many facts are needed to understand a piece of code)."]}),`
